' A v1.2 game with Modern opponents (`preset classic ai modern seed 15`),
' watched from Stove Vent as in v12_amiga_full: the human
' only drinks and ends the day, so the opponents' plans are what changes the
' world. Twelve days straight, with the cut's save after the sixth (on the world map) and a save at the end.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 354,317         ' in
wait 60
mapclick 179,235         ' the spring
wait 40
esc
wait 10
day
wait 10
